--[[
    Story Auto Farm (merged): Story + Battle Towers + Halloween Tower + Hard Tower + Auto Raid + Tickets

    FARM SLOTS (the script enforces them, you don't have to remember):
      Slot 1 "Story"     : Story farm
      Slot 2 "Tower run" : Battle Towers / Halloween Tower / Hard Tower / Auto Raid  (only ONE of these)
    So at most 2 farms run together (Story + one tower-type farm). Starting a farm whose slot is
    taken shows "Can't start X: Y is running. Turn it off first." and X does not start.

    - StartStoryBattle(world, boss, difficulty, team) + StoryFightDone(GrantId)
    - Difficulty: 1=Easy 2=Medium 3=Hard 4=Extreme 5=Nightmare 6=Insanity
    - Cooldown is per boss AND per difficulty; "All difficulties" farms ASCENDING.
    - Cooldowns are read from the server (GetStoryTicketState); settings are saved to
      StoryAutoFarmSettings.json; after Rejoin / Server Hop the running farms start again.
    - Halloween: GetTowerRunSummary("Halloween") + StartTowerRun("Halloween", {Part, Team}); the server
      climbs the parts, the script only starts the next first-clear part when no run is active.
    - Hard Tower: TowerNextFloor("Hard") floor by floor (the game's own auto-climb must be OFF).
    - Raid Logger tab: logs RaidRemotes calls + replies (Copy log).
]]

